
       ╭─  Open a pull request ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
       │                                                                                              │
       │  o/r   feat/x → main   2 commits                                                            │
       │                                                                                              │
       │  ❯ title   Feat/x                                                                            │
       │                                                                                              │
       │    base    main   ←/→ to change                                                              │
       │                                                                                              │
       │    draft   [ ] open as a draft                                                               │
       │                                                                                              │
       │    body                                                                                      │
       │  ╭─ Write │ Preview ────────────────────────────── from .github/pull_request_template.md ─╮  │
